; untested; the filter acts only on ports the NHI verifies and assigns.
%TbBridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_8A1D&CC_0604
%TbBridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_8A1F&CC_0604
