%U4BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_A76E&CC_0604
%U4BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_A71F&CC_0604
%U4BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_A72F&CC_0604
; Design record 22 section 3.7 (task 40-0.2): the USB4-only hosts' tunnel
; ports where pci.ids 2026.10.14 labels a port as such - the Barlow Ridge
; host bridges, AMD's USB4 PCIe tunnel ports and bridge, ASMedia's ASM4242
; downstream port. Lunar, Panther and Wildcat Lake name none; their sets
; come from XhciCmTunnelBridge. All untested.
%U4BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_5780&CC_0604
%U4BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_5783&CC_0604
%U4BridgeDesc%=CmF.Dev,PCI\VEN_1022&DEV_14CD&CC_0604
